================================================================
 IPA v2.6L driver port: Asus SDM660 vendor 4.19 → mainline 6.19
================================================================

 From: android_kernel_asus_sdm660 (Asus 4.19 stock baseline)
 To:   qcom-sdm660-6.19.y (ipa-hybrid working state, sondy-stripped)

 Throughput result: 20.5 Mbps DL sustained over Vodafone CZ LTE,
 with vendor-init userspace bringup tool (separate artifact).

 HOW TO APPLY:
   cp -rT vendor-baseline-4.19/ $KERNEL_TREE/
   cd $KERNEL_TREE
   patch -p1 < patches/sdm660-ipa-port-4.19-to-6.19.patch
   patch -p1 < patches/rmnet-netif-csum.patch

 WHAT THIS PATCH COVERS:
   1. drivers/platform/msm/ipa/                  (parent dir: ipa_api,
      ipa_rm, Makefile mods + new Kconfig)
   2. drivers/platform/msm/ipa/ipa_v2/           (full driver port)
   3. drivers/platform/msm/sps/                  (BAM framework)
   4. include/linux/{shim headers}.h             (port shims)

 WHAT THIS PATCH DOES NOT COVER (handled separately):
   - drivers/net/ethernet/qualcomm/rmnet/        (use upstream rmnet
     + tiny rmnet-netif-csum.patch on top)

 Sondy stripped: ~128 IPA_SONDA() calls + ipa_sonda_dbg gates +
 runtime_sonda delayed-work + [BW_SONDA] in ipa_rm.c, etc.
 See POSTMARKETOS_X00TD_CELLULAR.md 'Debug instrumentation' section.

